              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao ayasuka ati, “Mu cishinkafye cakwa Yawe uwamweo, ngefyo na iwe wine uli uwamweo, nshakushe iyoo.” Kanshi epakuya bonse ku Yeriko.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
