        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Impuka ya bakasesema abafumine ku Yeriko abaletamba ifilecitika basosa abati, “Umupashi wakwa Eliya waikala pali Elisha.” Elyo baya mukumukumanya kabili bakontamika imitwe yabo pa cinso cakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bamweba ukuti, “Mona, ifwe fwe babomfi bobe natukwata abaume abamaka amakumi yasano (50). Leka baye balefwaya sokulu. Pantu limbi kuti Umupashi wakwa Yawe wacimusenda nauya musha ku ncende ya ku mpili nangu mwishika.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
